{"ref":"BDB, צָרְעָה","hw":"צָרְעָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צָרְעָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> Σαραα, etc. (cf. also Lag<sup>BN 85</sup>), in the Shephelah of Judah <strong>(</strong>TelAm. <em>Ṣarḫa</em>, named with <em>Aialuna</em>, Ajalon<strong>)</strong>;—<a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:33\" href=\"/Joshua.15.33\">Jos 15:33</a>, but assigned to <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:41\" href=\"/Joshua.19.41\">Dan 19:41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:2\" href=\"/Judges.13.2\">Ju 13:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:25\" href=\"/Judges.13.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:31\" href=\"/Judges.16.31\">16:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:2\" href=\"/Judges.18.2\">18:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:8\" href=\"/Judges.18.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:11\" href=\"/Judges.18.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.10\">2 Ch 11:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:29\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.29\">Ne 11:29</a>; mod. <em>Ṣarʿa</em>, 15 miles W. from Jerus., cf. GASm<sup>Geogr. 218</sup> Buhl<sup>Geogr. 195</sup>.","next":"BDB, צָרְעִי","prev":"BDB, צְרוּעָה"}